#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:4 551169057b4f4dd8b9523cab03c1629e
msgid "Mapflow <> QGIS"
msgstr "地图流<>QGIS"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:7 422c81bfe71b4e24badb7e9242b0d3c1
msgid ""
"Mapflow can be used via QGIS. You need to autohorise :doc:`authorization to "
"work with the Mapflow API <../userguides/mapflow_auth>` and get `API token "
"<https://app.mapflow.ai/account/api>`_ to login."
msgstr ""
"Mapflow可以通过QGIS使用。您需要自动授权才能使用 Mapflow API <../userguides/mapflow_auth>` 并获取 "
"API 令牌 <https://app.mapflow.ai/account/api>`_ 进行登录。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst 27c4ee6339214ba5960f1857927a72fc
msgid "Preview results"
msgstr "预览结果"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:15 3eba08264a374b858b5b01e3e74aa013
msgid ""
"Join Mapflow <> QGIS `open source project on Github "
"<https://github.com/Geoalert/mapflow-qgis>`_."
msgstr ""
"加入 Mapflow <> QGIS `Github 上的开源项目 <https://github.com/Geoalert/mapflow-"
"qgis>`_。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:18 f77bfa087db147e6babe1f69f21104ec
msgid "What is QGIS"
msgstr "什么是QGIS"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:20 a3aee130c2d24562981e56903450dc31
msgid ""
"QGIS (`qgis.org <https://www.qgis.org/>`_) is the leading and most popular "
"Open Source Desktop GIS. Users can visualize, manage, edit, analyse geodata,"
" and compose printable maps. Get a first impression with a more detailed "
"feature list. Know more about QGIS and istall it from `official site "
"<https://www.qgis.org/>`_."
msgstr ""
"QGIS (`qgis.org <https://www.qgis.org/>`_) 是领先且最受欢迎的开源桌面 "
"GIS。用户可以可视化、管理、编辑、分析地理数据并绘制可打印地图。通过更详细的功能列表获得第一印象。了解更多关于 QGIS 的信息并从`官方网站 "
"<https://www.qgis.org/>`_ 安装它。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:23 4ccbb0f23a8f4719bbb677f3b68bb27e
msgid ""
"QGIS has an interface for external Python plugins that allows to connect "
"more apps and extend core functionallity. Our \"Mapflow - QGIS\" app enables"
" connection to Mapflow :doc:`processing_api` to run AI-mapping and add "
"output as layers to the QGIS workspace."
msgstr ""
"QGIS 有一个外部 Python 插件的接口，允许连接更多应用程序并扩展核心功能。我们的“Mapflow - QGIS”应用程序可以连接到 "
"Mapflow:doc:`processing_api` 以运行 AI 映射并将输出作为图层添加到 QGIS 工作区。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:27 6e0a827433ed4a1abf1a71a37176c84a
msgid "How to install the plugin"
msgstr "如何安装插件"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:29 9e29175c8aae453aa4154d0942139017
msgid ""
"Click *Plugins* -–> *Manage...*, go to the *Not installed* (or *All*) tab "
"and enter \"MapFlow\" in the search box. Click *Install Plugin*. You will be"
" able to see then if the newer version of the app is available (in the "
"Upgradeable tab) and to check the changelog for details."
msgstr ""
"单击*插件* -–> "
"*管理...*，转到*未安装*（或*全部*）选项卡，然后在搜索框中输入“MapFlow”。单击*安装插件*。然后，您将能够查看应用程序的较新版本是否可用（在“可升级”选项卡中）并检查更改日志以获取详细信息。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:31 b88528a785c148e7963dfd876a230ac9
msgid ""
"The plugin icon has appeared in the QGIS Toolbar. If the icon isn't "
"automatically displayed, right-click on the Toolbar and check if the Mapflow"
" checkbox is activated."
msgstr "插件图标已出现在 QGIS 工具栏中。如果该图标未自动显示，请右键单击工具栏并检查 Mapflow 复选框是否已激活。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:36 f4f3a83d291847b6b1867ccd887677d2
msgid "How to login"
msgstr "如何登录"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:38 57e651895ced44ad950ca5ca72f1f624
msgid ""
"You need to log in with your credentials to start using the plugin. Go to "
"`mapflow.ai <https://app.mapflow.ai/>`_, register and obtain `API token "
"<https://app.mapflow.ai/account/api>`_."
msgstr ""
"您需要使用凭据登录才能开始使用该插件。前往`mapflow.ai <https://app.mapflow.ai/>`_，注册并获取`API token"
" <https://app.mapflow.ai/account/api>`_。"

#: 7fcf18a754e545ba89718f2a898f16db
