msgstr "登录窗口"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:47 7f04ab920f154c618feda38b4080034a
msgid ""
"Or you can use the `OAuth 2.0 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OAuth>`_ "
"protocol as a more convenient and secure way."
msgstr ""
"或者您可以使用“OAuth 2.0 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OAuth>”协议作为更方便、更安全的方式。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:50 3a919ad1f0824bcda814c8fc36d0d395
msgid ""
"Logging in with OAuth is a convenient feature, but still experimental for "
"us."
msgstr "使用 OAuth 登录是一项方便的功能，但对我们来说仍处于实验阶段。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:52 556397879a6146bf93a626ca14aa9550
msgid ""
"Also keep in mind that at the moment this feature does not support proxies."
msgstr "另请记住，目前此功能不支持代理。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:55 01a54dc30f874e22a016079bf283abb7
