#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:57 8bd907e7c99744358764cf6150ca58a5
msgid ""
"Information on how to log in using OAuth can be found in :doc:`this section "
"<../userguides/howto>`."
msgstr "有关如何使用 OAuth 登录的信息可以在:doc:`本节 <../userguides/howto>` 中找到。"

