#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:100 a4c985a99a624c7488f35a051ce3d3eb
msgid ""
"This tab is divided into two parts. First, you will see a list of your "
"projects. Here you can create, edit, and delete projects using the buttons "
"at the bottom of the panel. Various sorting options and a search for a "
"project by name are also available."
msgstr "该选项卡分为两部分。首先，您将看到您的项目列表。您可以在此处使用面板底部的按钮创建、编辑和删除项目。还提供各种排序选项和按名称搜索项目。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:102 1d12028d5f744e0590ac8dbc9f1d54a9
msgid ""
"Each project in the list is accompanied by its **State** column, which "
"combines the counts of **succeeded** processings, **failed** processings and"
" **planned** processings (Planned searches) using separate icons."
msgstr "列表中的每个项目都附有其**状态**列，该列使用单独的图标组合了**成功**处理、**失败**处理和**计划**处理（计划搜索）的计数。"

