#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:427 eb8d737e53c74bbf90eb432dc6bbfda6
msgid ""
"To start the processing you need to add the Polygon **Area of Interest** "
"(AOI)."
msgstr "要开始处理，您需要添加多边形 **感兴趣区域** (AOI)。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:429 045afbb06b9c4843850a8eea437d3761
msgid "The plugin has several built-in options for creating AOI."
msgstr "该插件有几个用于创建 AOI 的内置选项。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:431 5ced68303c2b4941ae2e4083b156f52d
msgid "Draw AOI at the map;"
msgstr "在地图上绘制AOI；"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:433 d6756907bb1a49998f7e53dfb2f50c10
msgid ""
"Use imagery extent (Imagery collection or Image extent will be used if the "
"processing is started by My imagery);"
msgstr "使用影像范围（如果通过“我的影像”启动处理，则将使用影像集合或影像范围）；"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:435 52079c91985545efbcee4e449d262384
msgid "Create new AOI from the map canvas extent using the \"+\" button."
msgstr "使用“+”按钮从地图画布范围创建新的 AOI。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:437 5296a02e279844999d52f265135bc144
msgid ""
"Besides, you can create a new vector layer or add existing AOI into QGIS "
"project. If the vector layer consists of several polygons select one of "
"them."
msgstr "此外，您可以创建新的矢量图层或将现有的 AOI 添加到 QGIS 项目中。如果矢量图层由多个多边形组成，请选择其中之一。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst 9a6610706c3644ffba799187eb3a5f72
msgid "View of the aoi"
msgstr "苍井空的景色"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:446 44b491688b9142689214f4b654a81cd8
msgid ""
"Before starting, the plugin checks the **area limits of your plan**: the "
"bounding box of each AOI and the total processing area are verified, and if "
"the limit is exceeded the *Start processing* button is blocked."
msgstr "在开始之前，该插件会检查您的计划的**区域限制：验证每个 AOI 的边界框和总处理区域，如果超出限制，则会阻止 *开始处理* 按钮。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:453 508b0abe4c9b4aa595f2ad0220a2dba8
msgid "\\* Dash line is the actual AOI bbox"
msgstr "\\* 虚线是实际的 AOI bbox"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:457 acd3fcf96fde42308dda1f1f4fd1db3b
msgid "Use of commercial satellite imagery providers"
msgstr "使用商业卫星图像提供商"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:460 7ad91ad2db8c439a986f392f5cfba777
msgid "How to search for specific images in the 🌏 Global mosaic"
msgstr "如何在🌏全局马赛克中搜索特定图像"

#: ../userguides/search_mosaic.rst:1 aaa66d7b26e641599211485c0a3e3c3b
msgid ""
"Mapflow Imagery Search enables searching metadata for mosaic providers "
"(e.g., ArcGIS World Imagery, Global mosaic)."
msgstr "Mapflow 影像搜索支持搜索镶嵌提供者的元数据（例如，ArcGIS World Imagery、全球镶嵌）。"

#: ../userguides/search_mosaic.rst:4 8990efa2956e4151bcdd5befa3fa8f25
msgid ""
"**🌏 Global mosaic** is the annually updated satellite imagery composite "
"covering most of the World. The mosaic is composed of \"Jilin\" Chinese "
"satellites imagery (RGB, 0.75–0.5 m/px). The preview is limited to zoom 14. "
"**🌏 ArcGIS World Imagery** is a provider of the global coverage composed of "
"high and medium resolution satellite imagery and aerial imagery, hosted by "
"ESRI. The frequency of updating images is 1-5 years depending on the "
"territory."
msgstr ""
"**🌏 全球马赛克** 是覆盖世界大部分地区的每年更新的卫星图像合成。该马赛克由“吉林”中国卫星图像（RGB，0.75–0.5 "
"m/px）组成。预览仅限缩放 14。 **🌏 ArcGIS World Imagery** 是由 ESRI "
"托管的由高分辨率和中分辨率卫星图像和航空图像组成的全球覆盖范围的提供商。更新图像的频率为 1-5 年，具体取决于地区。"

#: ../userguides/search_mosaic.rst:7 2cf353ec2a11493dbde3b4e023b66f13
msgid ""
"How to use :doc:`Mapflow – QGIS <qgis_plugin>` to search for mosaic's "
"metadata and run the analysis:"
msgstr "如何使用 Mapflow – QGIS <qgis_plugin>` 搜索马赛克的元数据并运行分析："

#: ../userguides/search_mosaic.rst:9 c5205f305af743a5b96e80cc18376721
msgid "Switch to the Tab \"Imagery Search\""
msgstr "切换到“图像搜索”选项卡"

#: ../userguides/search_mosaic.rst:10 e4ec2ec9aa12477c93f241ba6d9090ad
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Set search filter parameters including the area (it can be your area of "
"analysis or a map canvas), period of time, cloud %, and the % of the "
"intersection with AOI."
msgstr "设置搜索过滤器参数，包括区域（可以是分析区域或地图画布）、时间段、云百分比以及与 AOI 相交的百分比。"

#: ../userguides/search_mosaic.rst:11 da5bc17075f14527a4c17175624507ea
msgid ""
"Select the \"Product type = Mosaic\" in the Search results. You will see the"
" mosaic image \"cutline\" indicating the specific image that is used in the "
"mosaic."
msgstr "在搜索结果中选择“产品类型=马赛克”。您将看到马赛克图像“剪切线”，指示马赛克中使用的特定图像。"

#: 12cfbfdd9d5b4f5f8ce12869934c5e62
msgid "Search for Mosaic images"
msgstr "搜索马赛克图像"

#: ../userguides/search_mosaic.rst:22 3afd362a6e87436fa9f099ffecae64bb
msgid ""
"There are two types of products in the Imagery Search API available: * The "
"**Scene** product is available for ordering by request. Now you need to "
"contact us to order the specific image. * The **Mosaic** product is "
"available for instant analysis if the corresponding data provider is linked "
"to your Mapflow account."
msgstr ""
"图像搜索 API 中有两种类型的产品可用： * **场景** 产品可根据请求订购。现在您需要联系我们订购特定图像。 * 如果相应的数据提供商链接到您的 "
"Mapflow 帐户，则 **Mosaic** 产品可用于即时分析。"

#: ../userguides/search_mosaic.rst:26 930b63877f7846edae1922c5f09f9b4c
msgid ""
"Run the processing. The resulting area of analysis will be clipped by the "
"intersection with the area of analysis."
msgstr "运行处理。生成的分析区域将被与分析区域的交集剪切。"

#: 5db513c6e7db4e66b3aeee39a99f021d
msgid "Get results based on Mosaic analysis"
msgstr "根据马赛克分析获取结果"

#: ../userguides/search_mosaic.rst:35 7bc45746af9f472f89d337a10eb589b8
msgid ""
"To run the processing over the whole area of analysis – just clear the "
"selection and use the **Data Source: 🌏 Global mosaic 2022** or the **Data "
"Source: 🌏 ArcGIS World Imagery**."
msgstr "要对整个分析区域运行处理 - 只需清除选择并使用 **数据源：🌏 全球镶嵌 2022** 或 **数据源：🌏 ArcGIS 世界影像**。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:467 0f93e99c2edd4739a494df6a4bbaa47e
msgid "How to connect to Maxar"
msgstr "如何连接到 Maxar"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:470 f981a49f802640aba8b08ffcc304d6ba
msgid ""
"SecureWatch (new name - ) is a service that provides global access to high-"
"resolution satellite images and imagery basemaps from the world leader in "
"remote sensing, MAXAR, through the subscription model. The spatial "
"resolution of images varies in the range from 30 cm to 1 m. All images are "
"accompanied by metadata, including information about the acquisition date "
"and time, cloud cover etc. In our application we implemented the special "
"interface to connect to this service and use imagery via Mapflow's "
"processings pipelines."
msgstr ""
"SecureWatch（新名称 - ）是一项通过订阅模式提供全球遥感领先者 MAXAR 提供的高分辨率卫星图像和图像底图访问服务。图像的空间分辨率在30"
" cm 至1 m 范围内变化。所有图像都附有元数据，包括有关采集日期和时间、云层覆盖等的信息。在我们的应用程序中，我们实现了特殊接口来连接到此服务并通过"
" Mapflow 的处理管道使用图像。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:473 1432e364b55f4a46a4fb7086e8203f0c
msgid "**Use of embedded Maxar SecureWatch for image processing by Mapflow**"
msgstr "**使用嵌入式 Maxar SecureWatch 通过 Mapflow 进行图像处理**"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:475 9ef08413fb014e4ea231a0d18eb93d3a
msgid ""
"In the *Settings -- Add or edit imagery providers* select the type *Maxar "
"WTS*, switch to the *Imagery search* tab."
msgstr "在*设置 -- 添加或编辑图像提供者*中，选择类型*Maxar WTS*，切换到*图像搜索*选项卡。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:477 12ff993512ba49f099bab6dc54c85d88
msgid "**Maxar preview**"
msgstr "**麦克萨预览**"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:479 d2c7e203d53442d88acd91354c5c01c0
msgid ""
"Select your AOI in the Area drop-down list and click on the *Search "
"imagery*."
msgstr "在区域下拉列表中选择您的 AOI，然后单击“搜索图像”。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:480 eb5f9cf504ee4aa7abc29174d876b7a0
msgid ""
"Double click on the selected image in the search results (or click Preview "
"button) to add it on the map."
msgstr "双击搜索结果中选定的图像（或单击预览按钮）将其添加到地图上。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:483 2cbb0d0bcecf44f5824d003bcfeeebaa
msgid ""
"In the free tariff plan the *Max zoom* is limited up to 12 and the "
"processing cannot be started using SecureWatch. If you want to use this data"
" provider - you have to switch to the `Premium "
"<https://mapflow.ai/pricing>`_ tariff plan or `write to us "
"<https://geoalert.io/#contacts>`_ to get a quote."
msgstr ""
"在免费关税计划中，*最大缩放* 限制为 12，并且无法使用 SecureWatch 开始处理。如果您想使用此数据提供商 - 您必须切换到“高级 "
"<https://mapflow.ai/pricing>”资费计划或“写信给我们 "
"<https://geoalert.io/#contacts>”以获取报价。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:487 f897012aa1e64ce18585c1b333a1a324
msgid "**Using your SecureWatch account for image processing by the Mapflow**"
msgstr "**使用您的 SecureWatch 帐户通过 Mapflow 进行图像处理**"

#: 12e22218d9984d6cb99cff1cde918954
