msgstr "输入您的 Maxar SecureWatch 帐户的*登录名/密码*；"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:502 8848a7e8fc834cb694bb78669e44dc9c
msgid ""
"Enter WMTS URL link for Maxar Secure Watch (`SecureWatch "
"<https://securewatch.digitalglobe.com/myDigitalGlobe/logout-from-ended-"
"session>`_ - Login - Securewatch - Use with - Web Services - WMTS)"
msgstr ""
"输入 Maxar Secure Watch 的 WMTS URL 链接（`SecureWatch "
"<https://securewatch.digitalglobe.com/myDigitalGlobe/logout-from-end-"
"session>`_ - 登录 - Securewatch - 使用 - Web 服务 - WMTS）"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:504 4b1675aa3dec40e8a044c9a93ace3af4
msgid "Optional: specify the coordinate system (default epsg:3857);"
msgstr "可选：指定坐标系（默认epsg：3857）；"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:506 7f1c5250c5b3459e94da7eafc40ea8d3
msgid "Optional: Check *Save login and password*"
msgstr "可选：选中*保存登录名和密码*"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:510 ba37aab2a4894c20a8c0d2e2f243e9d3
