msgstr "如何查找 Maxar WMTS URL："

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:512 b2c311a101fd406cb22bfc292cdb2011
msgid ""
"Go to `SecureWatch "
"<https://securewatch.digitalglobe.com/myDigitalGlobe/logout-from-ended-"
