msgstr ""
"转到“SecureWatch <https://securewatch.digitalglobe.com/myDigitalGlobe/logout-"
"from-ending-session>”_并登录。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:514 f5d4cd981dca4a6abdd4a0e7a4de1ef2
msgid "In the upper menu select **Use With** >> **Web Services** >> **WMTS**"
msgstr "在上方菜单中选择 **使用** >> **Web 服务** >> **WMTS**"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:516 4e1db5d1c9dd49d0bd444ac313438b13
msgid "Copy the WMTS (or TMS) url."
msgstr "复制 WMTS（或 TMS）URL。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst 1fda2f8207c94ecbbf3facee6b7ee8f9
msgid "Your user profile in SecureWatch"
msgstr "您在 SecureWatch 中的用户个人资料"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:524 1b60f0f21e094c0e8a5fba3cabeae8fc
msgid ""
"The **Connect ID** is different for each product you have in your "
"SecureWatch subscription. Therefore, initially choose the one you want. To "
"do this, open the *User Profile* menu and in the title bar select the "
"required of the two suggested mosaics (**Vivid** and **SecureWatch**)."
msgstr ""
"对于您的 SecureWatch 订阅中的每个产品，**Connect ID** "
"都不同。因此，首先选择您想要的。为此，请打开“用户配置文件”菜单，然后在标题栏中选择两个建议马赛克（**Vivid** 和 "
"**SecureWatch**）中所需的。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:527 a5148ed16fee42a5a307942b8740fb0b
msgid "Click *Preview*."
msgstr "单击*预览*。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:529 837ed25e5e4748b6977399821ea7cf22
msgid ""
"Now the Maxar layer is available for preview in your raster layers list and "
"for the AI-mapping processing using Mapflow."
msgstr "现在，Maxar 图层可在栅格图层列表中预览，并可使用 Mapflow 进行 AI 制图处理。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:533 624ab51f0052456fbdce46e0eb3f4721
msgid ""
"How to find and process the image by Feature ID using Maxar SecureWatch"
msgstr "如何使用 Maxar SecureWatch 按功能 ID 查找和处理图像"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:535 0797172912df4ae99fa43d16a0cd0987
msgid "You can use SW to discover available images for you area of interest."
msgstr "您可以使用 SW 来发现您感兴趣的区域的可用图像。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:537 89fbecd0b6c141ab8e620792ee8c77f1
msgid "Go to the *Providers* tab."
msgstr "转到*提供商*选项卡。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:538 b9a873af0d824ca7b0cd26f707c6e148
msgid "Select Maxar SecureWatch from the dropdown list."
msgstr "从下拉列表中选择 Maxar SecureWatch。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:539 7180c071f2044ce68f76a0d16e77163b
msgid ""
"In the *Maxar SecureWatch imagery Catalog* select the vector layer "
"containing the boundary of your area of interest."
msgstr "在*Maxar SecureWatch 图像目录*中，选择包含您感兴趣区域边界的矢量图层。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:542 f26c839c14a9424597983eba1d9106f8
msgid ""
"To define the imagery search area you can create the new polygon (*Layer -> "
"Create layer -> ...*, select *Polygon* as a geometry type, add polygon using"
" the tool *Add polygon feature*) or upload it from the file with "
"coordinates. If there is more than one polygon in the file, select with the "
"tool *Select object(s)* the polygon you need. For more information on "
"creating and working with vector layers, see the `QGIS User Guide "
"<https://docs.qgis.org/3.16/en/docs/training_manual/create_vector_data/create_new_vector.html>`_."
" Alternatively, you can check the option \"use canvas extent\"."
msgstr ""
"要定义图像搜索区域，您可以创建新的多边形（*图层 -> 创建图层 -> ...*，选择 *多边形* 作为几何类型，使用工具 *添加多边形特征* "
"添加多边形）或从带有坐标的文件上传它。如果文件中有多个多边形，请使用“选择对象”工具选择您需要的多边形。有关创建和使用矢量图层的更多信息，请参阅“QGIS"
" 用户指南 "
"<https://docs.qgis.org/3.16/en/docs/training_manual/create_vector_data/create_new_vector.html>”_。或者，您可以选中“使用画布范围”选项。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst 5a39c08315a04d4c8973b8cac205a0ef
msgid "Get specific image from SW"
msgstr "从SW获取具体图像"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:550 7894fe77a349439f93a70bc32fb59b71
msgid ""
"*Search imagery*, to view meta-data of all available images intesecting your"
" AOI. You can apply search filters and specify the period for which you "
"would like to receive images. This will help in forming an imagery catalog "
"with the necessary parameters."
msgstr ""
"*搜索图像*，查看与您的 AOI 相交的所有可用图像的元数据。您可以应用搜索过滤器并指定您希望接收图像的时间段。这将有助于形成具有必要参数的图像目录。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:551 4560d48f070843a281844d1b2991d1f6
msgid ""
"Select the prteferable image from the imagery catalog or use the WFS "
"generated vector layer (*Maxar SW metadata*) to search through more "
"attributes. If you want to process a specific image in advance, insert your "
"image ID in the field on the top of the plugin, this will make it easier to "
"find the image in the imagery catalog."
msgstr ""
"从影像目录中选择首选影像或使用 WFS 生成的矢量图层（*Maxar SW "
"元数据*）来搜索更多属性。如果您想提前处理特定图像，请在插件顶部的字段中插入您的图像 ID，这样可以更轻松地在图像目录中查找该图像。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:554 e5b3676ee75447eda0908bbcad293cea
msgid ""
"Imagery metadata is saved in the form of vector layer. You can interact with"
" its Attribute Table by searching through all attributes."
msgstr "影像元数据以矢量图层的形式保存。您可以通过搜索所有属性来与其属性表进行交互。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:556 ac915012704b48c7aeb10b90d65f2f4f
msgid ""
"Click *Preview* to view the selected image in the form of new raster layer "
"(or double-clicking on the row in the table)."
msgstr "单击“预览”以新栅格图层的形式查看所选图像（或双击表中的行）。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:559 04ab3a81844b4c99ac4c602cabffb5d9
msgid ""
"\"max zoom 12\" checkbox is active to prevent the paid streaming on the side"
" of Maxar SecureWatch."
msgstr "“最大缩放 12”复选框处于活动状态，可防止 Maxar SecureWatch 一侧的付费流媒体。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:563 ec7f8ca90cc94b8f9c54cb69b2215391
msgid "How to use other imagery services"
msgstr "如何使用其他影像服务"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:565 b09e790295574aa49b53b4406f63ece9
msgid ""
"Go to the plugin, on the *Providers* tab click on the *Add* (1) and enter "
"the relevant data in the opened window (2). Click the *Preview* (3) the "
"image, - you must be at the correct zoom and coordinates to see the image."
msgstr ""
"转到插件，在 *Providers* 选项卡上单击 *Add* (1) 并在打开的窗口 (2) 中输入相关数据。单击*预览* (3) 图像，- "
"您必须处于正确的缩放和坐标才能查看图像。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:567 74f0abd2f698454881745b156fb47142
msgid ""
"To start processing using this data source, go to the *Processing* tab, fill"
" in all fields of processing parameters, click *Start processing*."
msgstr "要使用此数据源开始处理，请转到*处理*选项卡，填写处理参数的所有字段，然后单击*开始处理*。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst 3ad2375bace549f1a8dfb230866b0bdb
msgid "Custom imagery source"
msgstr "自定义图像源"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:582 82f016a0549744f3b9447b2583e98f5e
msgid "Name"
msgstr "姓名"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:583 63ae8ed64876422e936480e6346c0de2
msgid "Name of other imagery data provider"
msgstr "其他影像数据提供者名称"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:584 c0eea43548c64cc099b8981ad834cfc6
msgid "URL"
msgstr "网址"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:585 fa931527c0d4469383b7db85e3dc638a
msgid "URL of the imagery data provider"
msgstr "图像数据提供者的 URL"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:586 f24e3f7d3dde435fa978e327dd2fcfa9
msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:587 454b7fa150a749538e04a0c50459347a
msgid ""
"Data source type. You can enter your custom imagery source URL in one of the"
" following formats: `XYZ <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tiled_web_map>`_, "
"`TMS <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tile_Map_Service>`_, `WMS "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Web_Map_Tile_Service>`_, `Quadkey "
"<https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/bingmaps/articles/bing-maps-tile-"
"system>`_. All formats represent the most widely used protocols to fetch "
"georeferenced imagery via HTTP."
msgstr ""
"数据源类型。您可以采用以下格式之一输入自定义图像源 URL：`XYZ "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tiled_web_map>`_、`TMS "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tile_Map_Service>`_、`WMS "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Web_Map_Tile_Service>`_、`Quadkey "
"<https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/bingmaps/articles/bing-maps-tile-"
"system>`_。所有格式均代表通过 HTTP 获取地理参考图像的最广泛使用的协议。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:591 4e5d7607b4c440b0a56b067d07f576ed
msgid ""
"You can define your own source of data in XYZ format. The example: "
"``https://your_site.xyz/{z}/{x}/{y}``"
msgstr "您可以以 XYZ 格式定义自己的数据源。示例：``https://your_site.xyz/{z}/{x}/{y}``"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:596 f7b897b092f44f4181b9cc9335daab41
msgid "Check for more imagery sources connections in the UserGuide How To:"
msgstr "在用户指南中检查更多图像源连接："

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:598 a7633e8d353747abba6356acde353ed4
msgid "How to connect to :ref:`Openaerialmap <oae>`"
msgstr "如何连接到:ref:`Openaerialmap <oae>`"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:600 3fc037a194b24f228a50d438e6901447
msgid "How to connect to :ref:`Nearmap <Nearmap_>`"
msgstr "如何连接到:ref:`Nearmap <Nearmap_>`"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:602 2d6b5abc096d4aaeb6e7385e56dbcd9e
msgid "How to connect to :ref:`Maxar Imagery <Maxar SecureWatch>`"
msgstr "如何连接到:ref:`Maxar Imagery <Maxar SecureWatch>`"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:606 c4cac305c2b4484cb9589cccd967e169
msgid "How to upload your image"
msgstr "如何上传您的图片"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:608 f926dafd8ee541c5a7fa143440637cbf
msgid ""
"You can upload your own GeoTIFF using :ref:`My Imagery <My Imagery qgis>`."
msgstr "您可以使用:ref:`My Imagery <My Imagery qgis>` 上传您自己的 GeoTIFF。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:613 2cc610b29f39496f82bf5970045d951b
msgid ""
"Please, follow the requirements specified on the page with "
":doc:`../userguides/reference` when uploading your own images to the Mapflow"
" platform. If you get the error message while uploading your data, please "
"check the instruction :doc:`../userguides/howto`."
msgstr ""
"将您自己的图像上传到 Mapflow 平台时，请遵循 :doc:`../userguides/reference` "
"页面上指定的要求。如果您在上传数据时收到错误消息，请检查说明:doc:`../userguides/howto`。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:615 6894b7b5fcd144eb889fb28533f4bcec
msgid "**Check the data type**"
msgstr "**检查数据类型**"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:616 ff422c99b5cf484bac8b1913b5782184
msgid ""
"Your data is supposed to be automatically converted into RGB, 8bit. To "
"preprocess your data locally before uploading it to Mapflow you can use the "
"`preprocessing script "
"<https://github.com/Geoalert/mapflow_data_preprocessor/>`_"
msgstr ""
"您的数据应该自动转换为 RGB、8 位。要在将数据上传到 Mapflow 之前在本地对其进行预处理，您可以使用“预处理脚本 "
"<https://github.com/Geoalert/mapflow_data_preprocessor/>”_"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:617 a0ea2639a9ac4cbaafb8ccbf70134748
msgid "**Check the image size**"
msgstr "**检查图像尺寸**"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:618 7a0006281a044a44bc9d5c65cf791cb5
msgid ""
"Both sides image dimension must not exceed 65535x65535 pixels. If you have "
"larger images you should either cut them in smaller chunks or switch to the "
"`Mapflow Premium <https://geoalert.io/#contacts>`_."
msgstr ""
"双面图像尺寸不得超过 65535x65535 像素。如果您有较大的图像，您应该将它们切成较小的块或切换到“Mapflow Premium "
"<https://geoalert.io/#contacts>”_。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:619 e4c17cd19fda41248741fbabdc65be2d
msgid "**Check the number of channels**"
msgstr "**检查频道数量**"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:620 5cc7cfc2079746479fcc750f1db58552
msgid ""
"Normally, the Mapflow processes 3-bands RGB rendered images. Mapflow "
"platform can also process single-band (panchromatic) imagery, but the  "
"quality of the result may be worse than expected."
msgstr "通常，Mapflow 处理 3 波段 RGB 渲染图像。 Mapflow平台还可以处理单波段（全色）图像，但结果的质量可能比预期的要差。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:621 dc2233aa9f7d46b2bccd16f17999f790
msgid "**Check the projection and georeference**"
msgstr "**检查投影和地理参考**"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:622 7cd6678991294176b125920f27e42fa5
msgid ""
"Make sure that your imagery is georeferenced in geographic or projected "
"coordinate system."
msgstr "确保您的图像在地理或投影坐标系中进行地理参考。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:623 f18124cc346e48319d5d219b075078eb
msgid "**Check the resolution**"
msgstr "**检查分辨率**"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:624 c2ac1021634540009797f2699fb38a6b
msgid ""
"The resolution restrictions vary for different models, see "
":ref:`Model_requirements`"
msgstr "不同型号的分辨率限制有所不同，请参阅:ref:`Model_requirements`"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:629 c6a793aa39ee45d3b40542fb179a24c6
msgid "Work with results"
msgstr "注重结果"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:632 5385253be26d458299833dd2ce75029a
msgid "View the results"
msgstr "查看结果"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:634 a6fa87f4dd4e4c2ea709d100e24e0fce
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The processing results that are 100% complete can be downloaded as a vector "
"file to your local directory or streaming as a vector tiles and "
"automatically added as layer to QGIS workspace."
msgstr "100% 完成的处理结果可以作为矢量文件下载到本地目录或作为矢量图块流式传输，并自动作为图层添加到 QGIS 工作区。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:636 72fdf82ba1fa4dcbb7dc80ea189a3e3a
msgid ""
"Double click on the processing name in the :ref:`Processing "
"<Project/Processing>` table or select it and push the button \"View "
"results\". The layer will appear in the Layers panel (QGIS --> View --> "
"Panels --> Layers) in the folder \"Mapflow\". You can work with it further "
"as with the usual vector layer in QGIS."
msgstr ""
"双击处理 <项目/处理> 表中的处理名称，或选择它并按下“查看结果”按钮。该图层将出现在图层面板（QGIS --> 视图 --> 面板 --> "
"图层）中的“Mapflow”文件夹中。您可以像使用 QGIS 中的常用矢量图层一样进一步使用它。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:641 46b503e542ca4a678c61c109f3d3120b
msgid ""
"If the default AI model is used, the plugin automatically assigns predefined"
" styles to the vector layer. For all custom models / pipelines the single "
"default style is assigned. You can always change it."
msgstr "如果使用默认的AI模型，插件会自动将预定义的样式分配给矢量图层。对于所有自定义模型/管道，分配单一默认样式。您随时可以更改它。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:644 aca27d49a31b476894d3f06f7f6afa18
msgid "Save results"
msgstr "保存结果"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:645 edf2e1e36de74ca18c7c0622812da716
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The processing results, which are 100% complete, can be downloaded in "
"GeoJSON format, to do this, click on the ``Save results`` button, select "
"output directory in the window that appears and name the file to be saved."
msgstr "100% 完整的处理结果可以以 GeoJSON 格式下载，为此，请单击“保存结果”按钮，在出现的窗口中选择输出目录并命名要保存的文件。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:648 f1cf7b50e3de4f2ea11c4ca67e0bcd9e
msgid "Delete the processing"
msgstr "删除处理"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:650 a7f5976b2cc24c998717a35bc6c10d12
msgid ""
"To delete the processing - select it in the list, click the button "
"\"Delete\" and confirm."
msgstr "要删除处理 - 在列表中选择它，单击“删除”按钮并确认。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:653 bc56a7dd770f4acd95ff7fe10e1813eb
msgid ""
"The processing cannot be restored by user. Before the permanent deletion the"
" data backup is **temporarily stored** on the Mapflow server in case of "
"emergency. So if you deleted your results by mistake and want us to restore "
"the processing – send your request to the support without delay."
msgstr ""
"用户无法恢复该处理。在永久删除之前，数据备份**临时存储**在Mapflow服务器上，以备紧急情况使用。因此，如果您错误地删除了结果并希望我们恢复处理，请立即将您的请求发送给支持人员。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:657 838ef2bb54de4e9b92a54d34f5e3fef7
msgid "Review the results*"
msgstr "查看结果*"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:660 970d078c374841f3bdd367b3953cd8fa
msgid ""
"❗️ This option is available for the limited number of Mapflow customers who "
"have signed up for the enterprise support"
msgstr "❗️ 此选项适用于已注册企业支持的有限数量的 Mapflow 客户"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:662 181537c7341446329e645f6972b6faaa
msgid ""
"If activated, every completed processing comes with the status **\"Review "
"required\"**. The user can either accept the result or request the review, "
"so the support can reprocess it and get better results, until it meets the "
"requirements. To request the **Review** of the results:"
msgstr ""
"如果激活，每个已完成的处理都会带有**“需要审核”**状态。用户可以接受结果或请求审核，以便支持人员可以重新处理它并获得更好的结果，直到满足要求。请求对结果进行**审查**："

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:667 237f50824db44c448862fa042e2b3b1b
msgid ""
"Select the processing with the Status **\"Review required\"** and click the "
"\"Review\" button"
msgstr "选择状态**“需要审核”**的处理，然后单击“审核”按钮"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:669 003fc5f785a54664be37ba5f07b49bf8
msgid "Provide comments in the Review dialogue:"
msgstr "在评论对话框中提供评论："

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:672 2f0318b9a9234ca28ce6b3e3de07f73f
msgid "Add your comment on why and what you want us to make a review"
msgstr "添加您的评论，说明您希望我们进行审核的原因和内容"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:673 7e18d901501b4dc9aca4e8b5bcbfcc95
msgid ""
"*Optionally* Add the polygon area, highlighting the objects that are not "
"correctly processed, weren't identified correctly, etc – it will help us to "
"pay attention to the specific issues"
msgstr "*可选*添加多边形区域，突出显示未正确处理、未正确识别的对象等 - 这将帮助我们关注具体问题"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:674 9af87cd242684097bc65dae264298144
msgid "The processing Status will change to **\"In review\"**"
msgstr "处理状态将更改为 **“审核中”**"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst 1c12b0e48c44493d88f7ca92bd1f7677
#: d710bc60e2964252881f781099ce5ec6
msgid "Upload TIF, select from list"
msgstr "上传 TIF，从列表中选择"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:682 8f164121f5634d9685eeb02bde87ec7f
msgid "Select AOI and request a Review"
msgstr "选择 AOI 并请求审核"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:684 8477e7bb259549e5ae67e6c807a59e2f
msgid ""
"As soon as Review is done on our side the Status will change back to "
"**\"Review required\"**. Accept the results or return to the #1"
msgstr "一旦我们完成审核，状态将更改回**“需要审核”**。接受结果或返回#1"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:693 dd9453f127104acea0531ccdf23105c1
msgid "Accept the results when Review is done"
msgstr "审核完成后接受结果"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:697 9f599a8515954f719f818b4d1a891a49
msgid "Proxy-settings"
msgstr "代理设置"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst:699 a834e404cb1d4364a3d9f873636ecc98
msgid ""
"If you are behind a firewall, go to *QGIS* -> *Preferences* -> *Network* and"
" will please adjust the proxy settings for plugin connection."
msgstr "如果您位于防火墙后面，请进入 *QGIS* -> *首选项* -> *网络* 并请调整插件连接的代理设置。"

#: ../api/qgis_mapflow.rst a7921e1b34cd4549ae9c683dacea1585
msgid "Proxy settings"
msgstr "代理设置"

